  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1001.16 Continuing Eligibility for Surface Water Treatment Supplemental Grants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1001.16 Continuing Eligibility for Surface Water Treatment Supplemental Grants. In order to maintain its eligibility for the 10% supplemental grant, the system shall annually submit its current official billing schedule to the department.\n\nSource. # 10616, eff 6-1-14 (from Env-Dw 1001.14); ss by #14121, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34",
